==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elephantidae Papaou]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns.
**12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
